      "content": "wait, are you sure? they're actually kind of struggling to stay awake now and they're talking really nonsense. i'm a bit worried because i thought fruity breath was a bad sign. should i really just give them a snack and let them sleep? it seems like they might need more than that if they're this out of it.",
